hrifty Boss we all never expected!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_135","a","017",null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","It's just food and adventure supplies, but the quantities are spot-on, everything's well-balanced, and you even managed to hit the free shipping minimum!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_135","a","011","flower",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","With leadership qualities like yours, you will be running the greatest company in Nova in no time!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["se","se_018"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["chd",0,0,"avg3_143","a","002","awkward"],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","Shopkeeper","Excuse me, miss. Would you mind not standing in front of the counter if you're not paying?",0,""],["w",0.5],["chd",1,0,"avg3_143","a","002",null],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.1,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","I'm kinda regretting this already.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a","015","exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Ah! Sorry, I was just running my mouth. It was a compliment, haha!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","grocery_store",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Can you dial back the over-the-top lines a little? Coming up with a snarky reply for everything can be tiring, you know.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_135","a","018",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a","018",null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Gotta have a few lines prepared. It makes writing the report so much easier later!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_135","a","002","music",0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","That's one of the witches' favorite pro tips, you know!",0,""],["w",0.5],["hide","avg1_135"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Anyway... Asking a witch for image rights fee is beneath someone like me.",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","018","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","So in exchange, I'm having Mistique write a piece about Boss Accord Staffing—and in the process, take a few pictures for me.",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","As to what else she's going to do with the pics, ==W==I'm not going to ask.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","010","sigh",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","grocery_store",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Is it the right thing to do?==W== Oh well, I guess it counts as free advertising. Might bring in some extra business.",2,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"y","018",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","011","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Plus, it's solid proof to the girls that I'm not slacking off even on my day off!",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Little by little, I will build my everlasting authority. Mwa Ha Ha!",2,null],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_135","a","004",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,"attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","So you aren't carrying any of the stuff you just bought?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Last time I insisted on carrying everything back myself and ended up with strap marks all over my hands.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","018","star",null],["say","avg3_100","Ever since I found out they offer delivery, I've been hitting that free shipping minimum...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Speaking of which, I grabbed a packet of dried fish just to round out the order. I figured I'd share it with the others.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_050"],["ctl","avg1_135","a","003",null,null,-0.35,1.5,1.0,"JuGong","OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_135","Come on, learn to enjoy life a little...==W== This is supposed to be your day off!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a","017","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_135","a","018","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Trekking through the wilds, dealing with Monolith crises all the time... It's only fair for a Trekker to enjoy a bit of peace and quiet during a rare city break.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_135","a","012","exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","A chance like this only comes once in a long while. Are you seriously not gonna sneak in a snack to treat yourself?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","The snack is for everyone in the New Star Guild. I can't take them all for myself.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg1_135","a","010","shock",null,0.0,1.0,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_135","Oh my gosh, Boss! Who would've thought you were such a noble, team-minded leader!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_135","a","017",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Even when there's only one packet of snacks, you won't hesitate to share it with your loyal crew!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That's right. So none for you.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_050"],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.1,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","0","I hold up a piece of dried fish, dangling it right in front of Mistique's eyes.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a","011","attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Ah! It smells delicious!",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-150.0,null,null,"Linear",0.35,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,"exclamation",0.6,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_135","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["se","se_096"],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["hide","avg1_135",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","0","Her eyes follow the dried fish as I wave it around. Then she lunges … and misses.",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_135","a","015",0.7,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","It's clear as day...==W== Be it New Star Guild … or Boss Accord Staffing...==W== Business is booming for you!==W==",0,""],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,null,null,"Linear",0.35,null,null,null],["se","se_124"],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",1.0],["stg",0,150.0,null,null,"Linear",0.35,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,"flurry",0.5,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_135","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["se","se_096"],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["hide","avg1_135",0.5],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["say","0","Even while out of breath from trying to grab the dried fish, she keeps going with her rambling.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","grocery_store",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_135","a","015",0.35,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_135","I, I may just be a humble witch … but there's still plenty … I can do for you!==W== Don't you think...?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.1,"Li